        "text_f86DXW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NADCO® Tapes and Labels Inc. is an acknowledged leader in the pressure sensitive adhesive tape and label industries. They are devoted to the printing and die-cutting of tape and label products for all customers’ advertising demands, safety requirements, industrial applications and recreational needs. However, there may be a few things that you don’t know about NADCO®:</p>",
